      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "BlinkShield is a wellness app designed to protect your eyes from digital
    strain. Using a virtual pet system, computer vision, and interactive tips, the
    app encourages healthy screen habits \u2014 especially for students, gamers,
    and digital workers.\n\nThe project is inspired by published research from optometrists,
    peer-reviewed studies, and global eye care guidelines such as the 20-20-20 rule,
    as well as behavioral psychology to help form better digital habits."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
