  m_text: "By using this app, you agree to the following terms:\r\n\n1. Purpose\n\r\nBlinkShield
    is a virtual pet that helps promote eye care and digital balance. It provides
    tips, reminders, and progress tracking for healthy screen habits. \n\r\n2. Use
    of App\n\r\na. Use Blinky responsibly and only for personal, wellness, and educational
    purposes. \n\r\nb. Do not attempt to damage, hack, or misuse the app. \r\n\r\n3.
    User Data\n\na. We collect basic info (like name, email, and progress) to personalize
    your experience. \r\n\nb. Your data stays private and is not shared with anyone
    outside the BlinkShield team. \r\n\r\n4. Health Notice\nBlinkShield is not a
    medical app. Tips and reminders are for guidance only.\r\nAlways consult an eye
    care professional if you have eye-related problems.\r\n\r\n5 Updates\r\nTerms
    and features may change as we improve BlinkShield. Continued use means you agree
    to the latest version.\r\n\r\n6. Contact Us\r\n\U0001F4E7blnkshld@gmail.com"
